<title>USA: NABI sets Q3 charge $0.04 - $0.06/shr.</title>
<headline>NABI sets Q3 charge $0.04 - $0.06/shr.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>NABI Inc said on Wednesday it would take a one-time third quarter charge of about $1.5 million to $2 million or $0.04 to $0.06 per share for its voluntary withdrawal ot some lots of its H-BIG drug.</p>
<p>The company said it withdrew lots distributed prior to 1996 in response to new testing requirements mandated by the U.S. Food and Drug Administration in June.</p>
<p>H-BIG is an immunotherapeutic used to prevent Hepatitis B transmission after accidental exposure.</p>
<p>It also said third quarter specialty plasma sales would be below second quarter sales due to lower spot sales revenues.</p>
